  headerImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 006a238136b50164a89f2a1585bc2edf, type: 3}
  brandLogo: {fileID: 2800000, guid: af8e43e2ecbdfdc4ab5c196865b7a756, type: 3}
  windowTitle: About
  brandTitle: URPLabStudio
  projectSubtitle: URP Visualization & Rendering Toolkit
  versionLabel: URPLabStudio / Version 1.0 / Unity 6.6 URP
  overviewText: 'URPLabStudio is a production-focused visualization and rendering toolkit built for Unity 6 URP.

    

    It combines configurable studio environments, runtime vehicle presentation, custom rendering systems, shader-based look development, and Scene View authoring tools into a unified workflow.

    

    The project includes realtime planar reflections, global and local volumetric fog, emissive decal workflows, configurable runtime UI, camera and vehicle presentation systems, and reusable editor utilities.

    

    URPLabStudio is designed for automotive visualization, product presentation, technical art experimentation, and practical URP production workflows.'
  mainTitle: URPLabStudio
  description: 'URPLabStudio is a Unity 6 URP visualization environment designed for automotive and product presentation, rendering development, runtime interaction, and editor workflow experimentation.

    

    It provides reusable scenes, configurable presentation systems, custom rendering features, and authoring tools for practical realtime visualization workflows.'
  environmentInfo: 'Developed and tested with Unity 6000.6.0f1 and the Universal Render Pipeline (URP).


    Designed for Unity 6 URP realtime visualization and rendering workflows.'
  features:
  - Configurable studio environments designed for automotive and product visualization, lighting evaluation, and realtime presentation.
  - Runtime controls for camera presets, vehicle interaction, body materials, wheel design, lighting, and presentation workflows.
  - Custom URP rendering features including emissive decals, realtime planar reflections, global volumetric fog, and localized fog volumes.
  - Custom URP shaders and Shader Graph workflows for vehicle materials, surface response, decals, reflections, and visual presentation.
  - Scene View authoring utilities including Decal Presets, Transform Overlay, and PrimTools for faster environment and visualization workflows.
  - Reusable motion system for Transform, Float, and rendering-property animation with configurable looping, easing, and playback control.
  urpLabDescription: 'URPLabStudio brings together realtime visualization, custom URP rendering, runtime interaction, and editor tooling in a reusable production-oriented project structure.

    

    The toolkit is designed to support practical technical art workflows while keeping scenes, rendering features, and authoring tools organized and accessible.'
